    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_09",
      "hash64": "A0255B35E046C95D",
      "text": "我们快来读一下介绍牌咧。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "3631694BB7E1ED0A",
      "text": "相传鬼拥有四个\\n闪闪发光的神奇面具。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_system_02",
      "hash64": "3631684BB7E1EB57",
      "text": "鬼所施展的棍棒力量\\n会因它戴的面具而异。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_system_03",
      "hash64": "3631674BB7E1E9A4",
      "text": "戴上绿色的面具，\\n能让枯萎的植物死而复生。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_system_04",
      "hash64": "3631664BB7E1E7F1",
      "text": "戴上红色的面具，\\n能让烛火熊熊燃烧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_system_05",
      "hash64": "3631654BB7E1E63E",
      "text": "戴上蓝色的面具，\\n能让河水停止流动。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_system_06",
      "hash64": "3631644BB7E1E48B",
      "text": "戴上灰色的面具，\\n坚硬的岩石也能轻松碾碎。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_system_07",
      "hash64": "3631634BB7E1E2D8",
      "text": "宝伴们在倒下之前夺走了三个面具，\\n几乎完全封印了鬼的力量。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_10",
      "hash64": "A028D835E049D39B",
      "text": "读完了……？[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
