      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_select_07",
      "hash64": "F3A40110EE588DFB",
      "text": "想去！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_select_08",
      "hash64": "F3A3FE10EE5888E2",
      "text": "怎么办……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_40",
      "hash64": "A032CA35E0521056",
      "text": "太、太好了！我也想……\\n让[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你看看那里。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_41",
      "hash64": "A032CB35E0521209",
      "text": "你不想去的话也没关系……\\n但是我好想让[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你……看看啊！[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_42",
      "hash64": "A032C835E0520CF0",
      "text": "从这里一直上去就是地狱谷，\\n那前面有个路牌，\\r\\n拐个弯就能到恐洞了。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_43",
      "hash64": "A032C935E0520EA3",
      "text": "那、那我先过去了，\\n你路上小心啊。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
